No! Yes!

275
00:19:20.493 --> 00:19:21.710
Yeah!
No!

276
00:19:26.791 --> 00:19:32.924
<i>And so I'm
offering this simple phrase</i>

277
00:19:33.422 --> 00:19:37.643
<i>To kids from one to 92</i>

278
00:19:38.386 --> 00:19:41.435
<i>Although it's been said</i>

279
00:19:41.597 --> 00:19:44.271
