Your room's in here.

292
00:20:20.428 --> 00:20:23.056
Grandma. watch me! Grandma!

293
00:20:24.181 --> 00:20:25.933
Thea. get down from there!

294
00:20:26.016 --> 00:20:27.734
Grandma. watch me!

295
00:20:28.102 --> 00:20:29.479
