about the garbage.

774
00:46:26.701 --> 00:46:28.061
What the hell are
we arguing about?

775
00:46:30.955 --> 00:46:32.628
I don't know. I...

776
00:46:35.876 --> 00:46:37.378
I don't know.

777
00:46:38.671 --> 00:46:39.718
Hey.

778
00:46:42.300 --> 00:46:43.347
No fair. I'm not armed.

779
00:46:43.718 --> 00:46:45.561
Then don't come any closer.

780
00:46:46.137 --> 00:46:47.434
Turn it off. Off.
No.

781
00:46:48.597 --> 00:46:50.065
